   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Hello all,<div><br></div><div>I am attempting to estimate a multiple indicator RI-CLPM in which I request FIML.x for missing and specify a panel sample weight using sampling.weights. The specifics of the call are:</div><div><br></div><div>its.riclpm.fl.weak.si.fit2 &lt;- lavaan(<a href=\"http://its.riclpm.fl.weak.si\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://its.riclpm.fl.weak.si&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792415189131000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1s2LSZwsA5015s9F59dHXh\">its.riclpm.fl.weak.si</a>,data=itsdata, estimator=&quot;MLR&quot;,missing=&quot;FIML.x&quot;,sampling.weights = &quot;t7finwt&quot;)<br></div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;ve received the following error message:</div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in stats::cov.wt(RAW, wt = wt[Mp$case.idx[[p]]], method = &quot;ML&quot;) : \r\n  weights must be non-negative and not all zero</span></span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\">\r\n<span style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87);font-family:Roboto,RobotoDraft,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">I checked the weights, and none are negative, and they are not all zero. That said, about 67% of the weights are zero because of attrition. I came across a recent post on Stack Overflow where someone is having a similar issue, but there has not been an answer provided yet.</span></span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\">\r\n\r\n</span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><br></span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/77626343/using-fiml-with-sample-weights-in-lavaan-with-fixed-x-f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://stackoverflow.com/questions/77626343/using-fiml-with-sample-weights-in-lavaan-with-fixed-x-f&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792415189131000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0YYAdx1VnfyEtre71UzJC7\">https://stackoverflow.com/questions/77626343/using-fiml-with-sample-weights-in-lavaan-with-fixed-x-f</a><br></span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><br></span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\">Any insights are much appreciated. Thank you.</span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><br></span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\">Best,</span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><br></span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\">Ryan</span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><br></span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><br></span></span></div>"
